<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22215" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γίξαι:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χωρῆσαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γίο:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτοῦ</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῖπον:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶπον</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γίς:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμὰς καὶ γῆ καὶ ἰσχύς</span> (i. e.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝίς</span>), Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γισάμεναι:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰδέναι</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γίσας:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθείρας</span>, Id.: inf., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γίσαι</span>”
				<i>deflower,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.Anth.
					4.73
				</span></i>
			 (perh. <i><span class="en">
				Strat.
			</span></i>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γίσγον:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴσον</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝίς ϝον</span>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γίσιον:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μικρὸν τεῖχος</span>, Id. (leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γείσ-</span>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γιστία:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσχάρα </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσχάτη</span> cod.), Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γιστίαι:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱστουργοί</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γιστιῶ:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παύσομαι</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γισχύν:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσχύν</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γιτέα:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰτέα </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐτέα</span> cod.), Id. (In the above words, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ</span> freq. 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝ.</span>
			) <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῖτον</span></b> , τό, dub. sens. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>UPZ</u>
				89.14
			</span></i>(pl., <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γίτονας</span></b> , 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γείτων</span>
			.</div>
